// Auto-generated for the Unit Board — Level 3 (2001–3000字) Unit 10
window.T10_DASHBOARD_UNITS = [{"unit":1,"theme":"angel – diver","cards":[{"w":"angel","p":"n.","d":"a spiritual being believed to act as an attendant, agent, or messenger of God; a very kind person","c":"天使；大善人（可數）","s":"The kind nurse stayed by the sick child's bed all night like a guardian angel of mercy.","t":"那位善良的護理師宛如仁慈的守護天使般，整夜陪伴在生病的孩子床邊。"},{"w":"angelic","p":"adj.","d":"relating to or like an angel; exceptionally beautiful, innocent, or kind","c":"天使般的；純潔美麗的","s":"The sleeping baby looked completely peaceful with a sweet and angelic smile on her face.","t":"熟睡中的小嬰兒臉上帶著甜美而天使般的微笑，看起來無比祥和。"},{"w":"devil","p":"n.","d":"the supreme spirit of evil; an evil or highly mischievous person","c":"魔鬼；惡魔；淘氣鬼（可數）","s":"We were just talking about David when he suddenly walked through the door, so I laughed and said, 'Speak of the devil!'","t":"我們剛剛正好在談論大衛，他突然就走進門來，於是我笑著說：「說曹操，曹操就到（魔鬼）！」"},{"w":"apron","p":"n.","d":"a protective garment worn over the front of one's clothes and tied at the back","c":"圍裙（可數）","s":"Before frying the fresh fish and chopping the garlic, the chef tied a clean white apron around his waist.","t":"在煎鮮魚與剁大蒜之前，主廚在腰間繫了一件乾淨的白色圍裙。"},{"w":"assume","p":"v.","d":"to suppose something to be the case without proof; to take on a role or duty","c":"假設；假定；承擔（責任/職位）","s":"When the senior manager suddenly fell ill, David had to step up and assume full responsibility for the project.","t":"當高階經理突然病倒時，大衛必須挺身而出承擔該專案的全部責任。"},{"w":"assumption","p":"n.","d":"a thing that is accepted as true or as certain to happen, without proof","c":"假定；假設；臆斷（可數/不可數）","s":"The entire budget proposal was prepared on the assumption that sales would grow steadily over the next five years.","t":"整份預算提案是基於未來五年銷售額將穩定成長的假定所編製的。"},{"w":"besides","p":"prep.","d":"in addition to; apart from","c":"除…之外（還…）（介系詞）","s":"Besides speaking fluent English and Spanish, the talented translator is currently learning Japanese at the university.","t":"除了能說流利的英語與西班牙語之外，那位有才華的翻譯家目前正在大學學習日語。"},{"w":"besides","p":"adv.","d":"in addition; as well; furthermore","c":"此外；而且（副詞）","s":"I really do not feel like going to the cinema tonight; besides, I have a pile of homework to complete.","t":"我今晚真的不想去電影院；況且／而且，我還有一大堆作業要完成。"},{"w":"bless","p":"v.","d":"to pronounce words in a religious rite to confer divine favor; to make happy","c":"為…祝福；保佑；賜福（動詞）","s":"The elderly priest smiled warmly and raised his hands to bless all the peaceful villagers gathered in the church.","t":"年長的牧師面帶溫暖的微笑，舉起雙手為聚集在教堂裡的所有平靜村民祈福保佑。"},{"w":"blessing","p":"n.","d":"God's favor and protection; a beneficial thing that one is grateful for","c":"祝福；幸事；恩惠（可數/不可數）","s":"Losing that boring office job turned out to be a blessing in disguise because it allowed him to start his dream bakery.","t":"失去那份枯燥的辦公室工作結果成了因禍得福的幸事（隱蔽的祝福），因為這讓他得以開設心目中夢想的烘焙坊。"},{"w":"bump","p":"v.","d":"to collide with something; to hit against an obstacle","c":"碰；撞；顛簸行進（動詞）","s":"While walking through the crowded airport terminal, I accidentally bumped into an old high school classmate.","t":"在穿過擁擠的機場航廈時，我不小心巧遇／撞上了一位高中老同學。"},{"w":"bump","p":"n.","d":"a light blow or collision; a raised swelling on the skin caused by a blow","c":"碰撞；腫塊；隆起處（可數）","s":"After falling off his bicycle onto the pavement, the little boy developed a painful red bump on his forehead.","t":"從自行車上摔落到人行道後，小男孩的前額腫起了一個疼痛的紅色腫塊。"},{"w":"creative","p":"adj.","d":"relating to or involving the imagination or original ideas","c":"有創意的；原創的；創作的","s":"The innovative art school encourages young students to develop their creative thinking through painting and sculpting.","t":"這所創新的藝術學校鼓勵年輕學子透過繪畫與雕塑來培養他們的創造性思維。"},{"w":"creativity","p":"n.","d":"the use of the imagination or original ideas, especially in an artistic work","c":"創造力；創意（不可數）","s":"Playing open-ended building games allows children to unleash their natural creativity without any restrictions.","t":"玩開放式的積木建築遊戲能讓孩童毫無拘束地釋放他們天生的創造力。"},{"w":"dive","p":"v.","d":"to plunge headfirst into water; to steep downward rapidly","c":"跳水；潛水；暴跌（動詞）","s":"Instead of hesitating for hours, you should just dive in and start solving the urgent project.","t":"與其猶豫不決好幾個小時，你應該直接全身心投入（跳進去）開始解決這項緊急專案。"},{"w":"diver","p":"n.","d":"a person who dives underwater, especially using scuba equipment","c":"潛水員；跳水選手（可數）","s":"Equipped with oxygen tanks and heavy wet suits, the experienced deep-sea diver explored the ancient sunken ship.","t":"配備著氧氣瓶與厚重防寒衣，經驗豐富的深海潛水員探索了古老的沉船。"}]},{"unit":2,"theme":"element – grassy","cards":[{"w":"element","p":"n.","d":"an essential part or aspect of something; the weather conditions, especially bad weather","c":"要素；元素；惡劣天氣（自然力）","s":"Although heavy snow was falling outside, the hikers decided to brave the elements and walk to the cabin.","t":"雖然戶外正下著大雪，健行者們仍決定冒著風雨惡劣天氣走向小木屋。"},{"w":"elementary","p":"adj.","d":"relating to the basic or simplest principles of something; introductory","c":"基礎的；初級的；小學的","s":"Every morning, hundreds of cheerful children walk hand in hand to the local elementary school.","t":"每天早晨，數百名快樂的孩子手牽著手走向當地的小學。"},{"w":"extreme","p":"adj.","d":"reaching a high or the highest degree; very severe, intense, or radical","c":"極端的；極度的；偏激的","s":"Because the icy mountain road was very slippery, the driver operated his car with extreme caution.","t":"因為結冰的山路非常濕滑，駕駛人以極度小心謹慎的方式行駛車輛。"},{"w":"extremely","p":"adv.","d":"to a very great degree; very","c":"極其；非常；無比地","s":"The summer afternoon in southern Taiwan was extremely hot and humid, so we stayed inside the cafe.","t":"台灣南部夏天的午後極其炎熱潮濕，所以我們待在咖啡館裡。"},{"w":"fairly","p":"adv.","d":"with justice and impartiality; to a moderately high degree","c":"公平地；公正地；相當地","s":"Our teacher always grades all test papers fairly without showing favoritism toward any student.","t":"我們的老師批改所有試卷時總是公平公正地，絕不偏袒任何學生。"},{"w":"faith","p":"n.","d":"complete trust or confidence in someone or something; religious belief","c":"信任；信心；信仰（不可數）","s":"Even when nobody believed in my business idea, my parents always had complete faith in my abilities.","t":"即使沒有人看好我的創業構想，我的父母始終對我的能力充滿完全的信心。"},{"w":"faithful","p":"adj.","d":"remaining loyal and steadfast; true to facts or original","c":"忠誠的；守信的；如實的","s":"The golden retriever has been a loyal and faithful companion to the old blind man for over ten years.","t":"這隻黃金獵犬十多年來一直是這位失明老人的忠實且忠誠的同伴。"},{"w":"flame","p":"n.","d":"a hot glowing body of ignited gas generated by something on fire","c":"火焰；火舌；光芒（可數/不可數）","s":"The dry wooden cabin suddenly burst into flames after being struck by a powerful bolt of lightning.","t":"乾燥的小木屋在被強烈雷電擊中後突然烈火燃燒。"},{"w":"flour","p":"n.","d":"a powder obtained by grinding grain, typically wheat, used to make bread and pastry","c":"麵粉（不可數）","s":"To bake delicious homemade sourdough bread, you need to mix fresh flour with warm water and yeast.","t":"要烘烤美味的自製酸種麵包，你需要將新鮮麵粉與溫水及酵母混合。"},{"w":"grasshopper","p":"n.","d":"a plant-eating insect with long hind legs that can jump high and produces a chirping sound","c":"蚱蜢；蝗蟲（可數）","s":"The curious little boy crouched down in the green lawn and tried to catch a green grasshopper with his hands.","t":"那個好奇的小男孩蹲在綠油油的草坪上，試圖用雙手抓一隻綠色的蚱蜢。"},{"w":"grassy","p":"adj.","d":"covered with grass, or smelling/resembling grass","c":"長滿草的；綠草如茵的；青草味的","s":"On sunny Saturday afternoons, many happy families sit on the grassy hill to enjoy a picnic together.","t":"在陽光明媚的星期六下午，許多快樂的家庭坐在長滿青草的山丘上一同享用野餐。"}]},{"unit":3,"theme":"harvest – quote","cards":[{"w":"harvest","p":"n.","d":"the process or period of gathering in crops; the quantity of a crop gathered","c":"收穫；收割；收成（可數/不可數）","s":"Favorable warm weather and adequate rainfall in spring resulted in a bountiful wheat harvest in autumn.","t":"春季溫暖的氣候與充足的降雨促成了秋天小麥的豐收。"},{"w":"harvest","p":"v.","d":"to gather a crop as a harvest; to collect or extract resources","c":"收割；採集；收成（動詞）","s":"Modern green technologies allow high-tech facilities to harvest solar energy and convert it into clean electricity.","t":"現代綠色科技使得高科技設施能夠採集太陽能並將其轉化為乾淨的電力。"},{"w":"merry","p":"adj.","d":"cheerful and lively; joyful and festive","c":"歡樂的；愉快的；興高采烈的","s":"Because it was the final day of the semester, students turned on cheerful music to make merry in the courtyard.","t":"因為這是本學期的最後一天，學生們在院子裡放起歡快的音樂尋歡作樂／盡情狂歡。"},{"w":"oak","p":"n.","d":"a large tree that bears acorns and has tough, durable wood; oak wood","c":"橡樹；橡木（可數/不可數）","s":"My grandfather built a heavy dining table crafted completely out of solid oak wood that has lasted forty years.","t":"我祖父打造了一張完全由堅固橡木精製而成的沉重餐桌，至今已歷經四十年之久。"},{"w":"omit","p":"v.","d":"to leave out or exclude someone or something, either intentionally or forgetfully","c":"略過；遺漏；省略（動詞）","s":"When delivering your concise oral summary to the executive board, please omit unnecessary minor details.","t":"向執行董事會進行簡明口頭摘要報告時，請略過不必要的次要細節。"},{"w":"optimistic","p":"adj.","d":"hopeful and confident about the future","c":"樂觀的；抱持希望的","s":"Despite experiencing several commercial setbacks, the ambitious founder remains highly optimistic about the company's future growth.","t":"儘管經歷了幾次商業挫折，這位胸懷大志的創辦人對公司未來的成長依然保持高度樂觀。"},{"w":"optimism","p":"n.","d":"hopefulness and confidence about the future or the success of something","c":"樂觀；樂觀主義（不可數）","s":"After positive medical trial results were published, a strong wave of optimism spread among doctors and patients.","t":"在正面的臨床試驗結果公布後，一股強烈的樂觀氛圍在醫師與病患間蔓延開來。"},{"w":"ownership","p":"n.","d":"the act, state, or right of possessing something","c":"所有權；產權；責任感（不可數）","s":"The official legal documents kept in the safe prove our family's clear ownership of this historic countryside cottage.","t":"存放在保險箱中的正式法律文件證明了我們家族對這棟歷史悠久的鄉村別墅擁有明確的所有權。"},{"w":"perform","p":"v.","d":"to carry out, accomplish, or fulfill an action; to present an entertainment to an audience","c":"執行；履行；表演；運轉（動詞）","s":"The chief surgeon prepared thoroughly to perform a delicate five-hour heart operation on the elderly patient.","t":"外科主任做了充分準備，為這位年邁病患執行／進行一場耗時五小時的精細心臟手術。"},{"w":"performance","p":"n.","d":"an act of staging or presenting a play or concert; the execution of an action","c":"演出；表演；表現；性能（可數/不可數）","s":"At the end of the magnificent ballet performance, the audience stood up and clapped enthusiastically for five minutes.","t":"在壯麗的芭蕾舞演出結束時，全場觀眾起立熱烈鼓掌長達五分鐘。"},{"w":"quote","p":"v.","d":"to repeat or copy out words from a text or speech written or spoken by another person","c":"引用；引述；報價（動詞）","s":"During his inspiring graduation address, the university president quoted a famous sentence from William Shakespeare.","t":"在啟發人心的畢業演說中，大學校長引用了威廉·莎士比亞的一句名言。"},{"w":"quote","p":"n.","d":"a quotation from a text or speech; an estimated price given for a job","c":"引文；名言；報價單（可數）","s":"The student opened his history research essay with an insightful quote from Abraham Lincoln about democracy.","t":"該學生在其歷史研究論文開篇使用了一句亞伯拉罕·林肯關於民主的深刻名言／引文。"}]},{"unit":4,"theme":"rid – timber","cards":[{"w":"rid","p":"v.","d":"to make someone or something free of an unwanted person, thing, or problem","c":"使擺脫；免除；清除（動詞）","s":"We hired a pest control company to completely rid our old wooden house of dangerous termites.","t":"我們聘請了一家除蟲公司，以徹底清除我們老木屋裡的危險白蟻。"},{"w":"rob","p":"v.","d":"to take property unlawfully from a person or place by force or threat of force","c":"搶劫；剝奪（動詞）","s":"Two masked men entered the jewelry shop with weapons and robbed the owner of thousands of dollars in diamonds.","t":"兩名蒙面男子持武器進入珠寶店，搶劫了店主價值數千美元的鑽石。"},{"w":"robber","p":"n.","d":"a person who commits robbery","c":"搶匪；強盜（可數）","s":"The brave police officer chased the fleeing armed robber down the crowded avenue and caught him near the station.","t":"勇敢的警官沿著擁擠的大道追捕那名逃跑的武裝搶匪，並在車站附近將他抓獲。"},{"w":"robbery","p":"n.","d":"the crime of taking or attempting to take anything of value by force or threat of force","c":"搶劫案；強盜罪（可數/不可數）","s":"Paying ten dollars for a tiny cup of tea at the tourist resort felt like complete daylight robbery!","t":"在觀光渡假勝地花十美元買一小杯茶，簡直就是公然敲竹槓（光天化日下的搶劫）！"},{"w":"silk","p":"n.","d":"a fine, strong, soft, lustrous fiber produced by silkworms; fabric made from this fiber","c":"絲；絲綢；絲織品（不可數）","s":"The graceful bride walked down the church aisle wearing an elegant wedding gown crafted from pure Chinese silk.","t":"那位優雅的新娘穿著一件由純中國絲綢精製而成的優雅婚紗，緩緩走過教堂走道。"},{"w":"silky","p":"adj.","d":"resembling silk in being soft, smooth, and lustrous","c":"如絲般的；柔滑的","s":"The shampoo contains natural oils that leave your hair looking shiny and feeling extraordinarily silky to the touch.","t":"這款洗髮精含有天然油脂，能讓你的頭髮看起來光亮，觸摸起來格外柔滑如絲。"},{"w":"specific","p":"adj.","d":"clearly defined or identified; relating uniquely to a particular subject","c":"特定的；具體的；明確的","s":"Could you please be more specific about what time you expect to arrive at the airport tomorrow morning?","t":"你能否再說得具體明確一些，你預計明天早晨幾點會抵達機場？"},{"w":"specifically","p":"adv.","d":"in a way that is detailed and exact; for a particular purpose","c":"特別地；具體地；專門地","s":"This lightweight wheelchair was designed specifically for elderly patients who have difficulty walking long distances.","t":"這款輕型輪椅是專門為難以長途步行的年長病患所設計的。"},{"w":"spoil","p":"v.","d":"to diminish or destroy the value or quality of something; to harm a child's character by being too lenient; to go bad","c":"破壞；糟蹋；寵壞（孩子）；變質（腐敗）","s":"Eating too many sweet chocolate candies before dinner will definitely spoil your appetite for healthy vegetables.","t":"晚飯前吃太多甜巧克力糖果肯定會破壞／糟蹋你想吃健康蔬菜的胃口。"},{"w":"squirrel","p":"n.","d":"an agile tree-dwelling rodent with a bushy tail, typically feeding on nuts and seeds","c":"松鼠（可數）","s":"In the city park, cheerful children love to toss roasted peanuts to a bushy-tailed squirrel sitting on the grass.","t":"在市立公園裡，快樂的孩子們喜歡把烤花生扔給坐在草地上一隻尾巴毛茸茸的松鼠。"},{"w":"swear","p":"v.","d":"to make a solemn statement or promise undertaking to do something; to use offensive language","c":"發誓；宣誓；咒罵（動詞）","s":"The new president raised his right hand in front of the supreme judge to swear an oath of loyalty to the nation.","t":"新任總統在大法官面前舉起右手，宣誓對國家恪盡忠誠。"},{"w":"timber","p":"n.","d":"wood prepared for use in building and carpentry; trees that can be harvested for wood","c":"木材；木料；林木（不可數/可數）","s":"Canada has vast forest reserves that support a thriving national timber industry supplying construction projects worldwide.","t":"加拿大擁有遼闊的森林儲備，支撐著蓬勃發展的全國木材工業，為全球的建築工程供應木料。"}]},{"unit":5,"theme":"tourism – wise","cards":[{"w":"tourism","p":"n.","d":"the commercial organization and operation of vacations and visits to places of interest","c":"觀光業；旅遊業（不可數）","s":"The tropical island nation relies heavily on international tourism to support its economy and create local jobs.","t":"這個熱帶島國高度仰賴國際觀光業來支撐其經濟並創造當地就業機會。"},{"w":"tourist","p":"n.","d":"a person who is traveling or visiting a place for pleasure","c":"觀光客；遊客（可數）","s":"Thousands of foreign tourists flock to the ancient Roman temple every day to take memorable photos.","t":"成千上萬的外國觀光客每天湧入古羅馬神廟拍攝難忘的照片。"},{"w":"tour","p":"n.","d":"a journey for pleasure in which several different places are visited","c":"旅行；巡迴演出；導覽（可數）","s":"We hired a knowledgeable local guide to take us on a fascinating historical tour of the old walled city.","t":"我們聘請了一位知識淵博的當地導遊，帶我們對這座古老的城牆城市進行了一次引人入勝的歷史導覽之旅。"},{"w":"tune","p":"n.","d":"a melody, especially one that is catchy and pleasing; state of being in harmony","c":"曲調；旋律；和諧（可數/不可數）","s":"An effective manager stays closely in tune with the needs and feelings of her frontline employees.","t":"一位有效率的經理始終與前線員工的需求和感受步調一致／密切共鳴。"},{"w":"tune","p":"v.","d":"to adjust a musical instrument to the correct pitch; to adjust a radio or TV to a frequency","c":"為（樂器）調音；收聽／收看（動詞）","s":"Before stepping onto the stage for the concert, the violinist carefully tuned her instrument to ensure perfect pitch.","t":"在登上舞台進行音樂會之前，小提琴家仔細地為她的樂器調音，以確保音準完美。"},{"w":"vocabulary","p":"n.","d":"the body of words used in a particular language or known to an individual","c":"字彙；詞彙量（可數/不可數）","s":"Reading high-quality English novels and news articles every day is the most effective way to expand your vocabulary.","t":"每天閱讀優質的英語小說與新聞文章是擴充字彙量最有效的方法。"},{"w":"volleyball","p":"n.","d":"a team game in which a large ball is hit by hand over a high net","c":"排球；排球運動（不可數/可數）","s":"During our summer vacation in Kenting, we loved gathering on the golden sand to play beach volleyball with friends.","t":"在墾丁的暑假期間，我們喜歡聚集在金黃色的沙灘上與朋友們一同打沙灘排球。"},{"w":"wisdom","p":"n.","d":"the quality of having experience, knowledge, and good judgment","c":"智慧；見識；明智（不可數）","s":"Before making any major life decisions, you should seek the valuable words of wisdom from your experienced grandparents.","t":"在做出任何人生重大決定之前，你應該向經驗豐富的祖父母尋求寶貴的智慧之言。"},{"w":"wise","p":"adj.","d":"having or showing experience, knowledge, and good judgment","c":"有智慧的；明智的；聰穎的","s":"Investing a portion of your monthly income in a secure retirement fund is a very wise and sensible financial decision.","t":"將每月收入的一部分投資於安全的退休基金是一個非常明智的且合理的財務決定。"}]}];
